  "solution": "Here, we use the BODMAS table given below:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/e10e3be1476caf1bd7e2e109842e7c57ce86da0c54b1b539e233e4e6a7748a44.png] \n\nGiven:\n\n⇒ 95 ÷ 19 × 112 ÷ (4 × 4 + 3) + 5 = 24\n\n(1) **112 and 95**\n\n⇒ 95 ÷ 19 × 112 ÷ (4 × 4 + 3) + 5\n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n⇒ 112 ÷ 19 × 95 ÷ __**(4 × 4 + 3)**__ + 5 = 24\n\nApply BODMAS rule:\n\n⇒ __**112 ÷ 19**__ × __**95 ÷ 19 **__+ 5\n\n⇒ __**5.89 × 5**__ + 5\n\n⇒ 29.47 + 5 = 34.47\n\nHere, the equation is not satisfied.\n\n(2) **4 and 5**\n\n⇒ 95 ÷ 19 × 112 ÷ (4 × 4 + 3) + 5 = 24\n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n⇒ 95 ÷ 19 × 112 ÷** __(5 × 5 + 3)__**__ __+ 4 = 24\n\nApply BODMAS rule:\n\n⇒ __**95 ÷ 19**__ × __**112 ÷ 28**__ + 4\n\n⇒ __**5 × 4**__ + 4\n\n⇒ 20 + 4 = **24**\n\n**⇒ **'95 ÷ 19 × 112 ÷ (5 × 5 + 3) + 4 = 24'\n\nHere, the equation is not satisfied.\n\n(3) **4 and 3**\n\n⇒ 95 ÷ 19 × 112 ÷ (4 × 4 + 3) + 5 = 24\n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n⇒ 95 ÷ 19 × 112 ÷ __**(3 × 3 + 4)**__ + 5 = 24\n\nApply BODMAS rule:\n\n⇒ __**95 ÷ 19**__ × __**112 ÷ (13**____**)**__ + 5\n\n⇒ __**5 × 8.61**__ + 5\n\n⇒ 43.07 + 5 = 48.07\n\nHere, the equation is satisfied.\n\n(4) **112 and 24**\n\n⇒ 95 ÷ 19 × 112 ÷ (4 × 4 + 3) + 5 = 24\n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n⇒ 95 ÷ 19 × 24 ÷ __**(4 × 4 + 3)**__ + 5 = 112\n\nApply BODMAS rule:\n\n⇒ __**95 ÷ 19**__ × __**24**____** ÷ (19)**__ + 5\n\n⇒ __**5 × 1.26**__ + 5\n\n⇒ 6.3 + 5 = 11.3\n\nHere, the equation is not satisfied.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (2)\".",
